## Build Process

### System Call

After modifying the kernel source:

```bash
make
make modules
make install
```

Reboot into the newly compiled kernel.

### Kernel Module

```bash
make
sudo insmod custom-iosched.ko
```

Verify loading:

```bash
lsmod
dmesg | tail
```

Remove the module:

```bash
sudo rmmod custom-iosched
```

